{"verse_key": "13:4", "surah": 13, "verse": 4, "text_uthmani": "وَفِى ٱلْأَرْضِ قِطَعٌ مُّتَجَـٰوِرَٰتٌ وَجَنَّـٰتٌ مِّنْ أَعْنَـٰبٍ وَزَرْعٌ وَنَخِيلٌ صِنْوَانٌ وَغَيْرُ صِنْوَانٍ يُسْقَىٰ بِمَآءٍ وَٰحِدٍ وَنُفَضِّلُ بَعْضَهَا عَلَىٰ بَعْضٍ فِى ٱلْأُكُلِ ۚ إِنَّ فِى ذَٰلِكَ لَـَٔايَـٰتٍ لِّقَوْمٍ يَعْقِلُونَ", "translation": "And within the land are neighboring plots and gardens of grapevines and crops and palm trees, [growing] several from a root or otherwise,<sup foot_note=196542>1</sup> watered with one water; but We make some of them exceed others in [quality of] fruit. Indeed in that are signs for a people who reason.", "verse_from_ms": 63762, "verse_to_ms": 101995, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/13.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَفِى", "start_ms": 63762, "end_ms": 64666}, {"i": 1, "text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "start_ms": 64666, "end_ms": 65331}, {"i": 2, "text": "قِطَعٌ", "start_ms": 65331, "end_ms": 66674}, {"i": 3, "text": "مُّتَجَـٰوِرَٰتٌ", "start_ms": 66674, "end_ms": 68747}, {"i": 4, "text": "وَجَنَّـٰتٌ", "start_ms": 68747, "end_ms": 70436}, {"i": 5, "text": "مِّنْ", "start_ms": 70436, "end_ms": 71055}, {"i": 6, "text": "أَعْنَـٰبٍ", "start_ms": 71055, "end_ms": 72644}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَزَرْعٌ", "start_ms": 72644, "end_ms": 73859}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَنَخِيلٌ", "start_ms": 73859, "end_ms": 76412}, {"i": 9, "text": "صِنْوَانٌ", "start_ms": 76412, "end_ms": 77964}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَغَيْرُ", "start_ms": 77964, "end_ms": 79459}, {"i": 11, "text": "صِنْوَانٍ", "start_ms": 79459, "end_ms": 81286}, {"i": 12, "text": "يُسْقَىٰ", "start_ms": 81286, "end_ms": 82085}, {"i": 13, "text": "بِمَآءٍ", "start_ms": 82085, "end_ms": 83569}, {"i": 14, "text": "وَٰحِدٍ", "start_ms": 83569, "end_ms": 84432}, {"i": 15, "text": "وَنُفَضِّلُ", "start_ms": 84432, "end_ms": 86379}, {"i": 16, "text": "بَعْضَهَا", "start_ms": 86379, "end_ms": 87629}, {"i": 17, "text": "عَلَىٰ", "start_ms": 87629, "end_ms": 89501}, {"i": 18, "text"